{"_type":"issue","id":"xl-now.2","title":"状态机与渲染解耦 + timeScale","description":"原版 paint() 有副作用：不调 paint 时 command.isDraw 恒为 false（实测 0/120 vs 59/120）。web 版必须把状态推进与渲染拆开，由外部 tick 驱动，否则标签页切后台被浏览器暂停 rAF 时战斗会冻住、切回来补跑几百帧。拆开后战斗逻辑可在无渲染下测试。timeScale 是 tick 步长乘系数，对应 Java 侧的 tools.Clock（实测 factor=10 提速 7.4x）。","acceptance_criteria":"战斗逻辑有不依赖渲染的单元测试；标签页切后台再切回不产生行为差异；timeScale 可调且线性。","status":"open","priority":2,"issue_type":"feature","owner":"yzong@turo.com","created_at":"2026-09-05T16:38:58Z","created_by":"Yanqi Zong","updated_at":"2026-09-05T16:38:58Z","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"xl-now.2","depends_on_id":"xl-now","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-09-05T09:38:57Z","created_by":"Yanqi Zong","metadata":"{}"},{"issue_id":"xl-now.2","depends_on_id":"xl-tkx.1","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-09-05T09:40:29Z","created_by":"Yanqi Zong","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":1,"dependent_count":1,"comment_count":0}
{"_type":"issue","id":"xl-now.1","title":"渲染核心：Pixi 场景层 + 固定 1024x640 逻辑分辨率","description":"画布锁死 1024x640（实测 getContentPane().getSize()，ScenePanel.WIDTH/HEIGHT 常量亦为此值），等比缩放居中 letterbox，支持全屏。默认平滑插值 + 提供「像素锐利」开关：素材是手绘/RPG Maker 渲染图不是像素画，最近邻放大会把原有抗锯齿变成台阶。不做响应式视野——战斗站位（560,160 / 750,150 / 800,330）与大地图可视范围都按此分辨率调过。","acceptance_criteria":"任意窗口尺寸下画面等比铺满且不横向滚动；全屏可用；两种插值可切换。","status":"open","priority":2,"issue_type":"feature","owner":"yzong@turo.com","created_at":"2026-09-05T16:38:57Z","created_by":"Yanqi Zong","updated_at":"2026-09-05T16:38:57Z","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"xl-now.1","depends_on_id":"xl-now","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-09-05T09:38:56Z","created_by":"Yanqi Zong","metadata":"{}"},{"issue_id":"xl-now.1","depends_on_id":"xl-tkx.1","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-09-05T09:40:28Z","created_by":"Yanqi Zong","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":1,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"_type":"issue","id":"xl-tkx.6","title":"验收流水线：取景 → 比对 → 报告","description":"把 tools/ 的取景器、剧本执行、帧差异审计串成一条命令。注意 Audit 的判据必须是「静止起点 + 静止后最大差异」，不能用 MD5 唯一性——后者没有诊断力。","acceptance_criteria":"一条命令产出两端帧序列与差异报告；报告含每条剧本的通过/失败与首个偏离帧。","status":"open","priority":2,"issue_type":"feature","owner":"yzong@turo.com","created_at":"2026-09-05T16:38:11Z","created_by":"Yanqi Zong","updated_at":"2026-09-05T16:38:11Z","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"xl-tkx.6","depends_on_id":"xl-tkx.4","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-09-05T09:40:35Z","created_by":"Yanqi Zong","metadata":"{}"},{"issue_id":"xl-tkx.6","depends_on_id":"xl-tkx","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-09-05T09:38:11Z","created_by":"Yanqi Zong","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":1,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
{"_type":"issue","id":"xl-tkx.5","title":"资产转码与懒加载（370MB 图 + 56MB 音频）","description":"PNG→WebP/AVIF、mp3+wav→Opus，按场景懒加载。公开部署下原样搬运不可接受。后续可再做精灵图集，但需先完成资产审计（2947 张图哪些属于同一组动画帧，目前该信息只存在于代码的路径拼接逻辑里）。","acceptance_criteria":"首屏加载量有明确预算并被 CI 检查；场景切换不阻塞。","status":"open","priority":2,"issue_type":"feature","owner":"yzong@turo.com","created_at":"2026-09-05T16:38:10Z","created_by":"Yanqi Zong","updated_at":"2026-09-05T16:38:10Z","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"xl-tkx.5","depends_on_id":"xl-tkx","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-09-05T09:38:10Z","created_by":"Yanqi Zong","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":1,"comment_count":0}
{"_type":"issue","id":"xl-tkx.4","title":"跨端剧本：格式 + Java 解释器 + Web 解释器 + 逐帧比对","description":"一份纯数据剧本（声明式，写「走到 (14,19)」而不是「按 12 次下键」），两端各自实现解释器，同一剧本两边跑、逐帧算差异。这是验收的唯一客观手段——人眼比对已被本次会话反复证明不可靠。","acceptance_criteria":"同一剧本在 Java 与 Web 各产出 N 帧；逐帧差异低于阈值即通过；超阈值时输出首个偏离帧号。","status":"open","priority":2,"issue_type":"feature","owner":"yzong@turo.com","created_at":"2026-09-05T16:38:09Z","created_by":"Yanqi Zong","updated_at":"2026-09-05T16:38:09Z","dependencies":[{"issue_id":"xl-tkx.4","depends_on_id":"xl-tkx","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-09-05T09:38:09Z","created_by":"Yanqi Zong","metadata":"{}"},{"issue_id":"xl-tkx.4","depends_on_id":"xl-tkx.1","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-09-05T09:40:34Z","created_by":"Yanqi Zong","metadata":"{}"}],"dependency_count":1,"dependent_count":1,"comment_count":0}
